# Mermaid Diagram Rules

สร้าง Mermaid Diagram ทุกครั้ง
เว้นแต่ผู้ใช้งานระบุว่าไม่ต้องการ

ใช้รูปแบบ:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Trigger]) --> B[Load configuration]
        B --> C[Get input data]
            C --> D{Input valid?}

                D -->|Yes| E[Execute main process]
                    D -->|No| V1[Record validation error]

                        E --> F{Processing result}

                            F -->|Success| S1[Update status: Completed]
                                F -->|Warning| W1[Update status: Completed with warning]
                                    F -->|Failed| E1[Capture technical error]

                                        S1 --> L1[Write success log]
                                            L1 --> N1[Send notification if required]
                                                N1 --> Z1([End: Success])

                                                    W1 --> L2[Write warning log]
                                                        L2 --> N2[Notify process owner]
                                                            N2 --> Z2([End: Warning])

                                                                V1 --> L3[Write validation log]
                                                                    L3 --> N3[Notify responsible user]
                                                                        N3 --> Z3([End: Validation failed])

                                                                            E1 --> R1{Retry allowed?}
                                                                                R1 -->|Yes| R2[Increase retry count]
                                                                                    R2 --> E
                                                                                        R1 -->|No| L4[Write error log]
                                                                                            L4 --> N4[Notify support]
                                                                                                N4 --> Z4([End: Failed])
                                                                                                